<navigation-bar title="首页" back="{{false}}" color="black" background="#D9CDB3"></navigation-bar>
<view bindtouchstart="touchstart" bindtouchend="touchend">
  <scroll-view type='list' class="first-screen-wrapper" :enhanced="true" :bounces="false" bind:tap="clickImage">
    <view class="max_carousel">
      <!-- <image data-index="{{index}}" wx:for="{{imges}}" wx:key="index" class="['imgCss', {{num == index ? 'ShowCss' : ''}}]" src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" /> -->
      <swiper 
        class="swiper" 
        indicator-dots="{{false}}" 
        indicator-active-color="#fff" 
        autoplay="{{true}}" 
        interval="{{6000}}" 
        duration="{{1500}}" 
        circular="{{true}}">
          <swiper-item wx:for="{{imges}}" wx:key="index">
            <image class="home-swiper" src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" />
          </swiper-item>          
    </swiper>
    </view>
    <image class="first-screen-text {{slide_direction == 0 ? 'first-screen-text2' : ''}}" src="https://yunshecun.oss-cn-guangzhou.aliyuncs.com/applet/img/logo.png.webp" mode="widthFix" />
    <!-- <view class="line_top" style="display:{{slide_direction == 0 ? 'none' : 'block'}}">
      <view class="line"></view>
    </view> -->
    <view class="{{slide_direction == 0 ? 'home-text-mask' : ''}}"></view>
    <view class="text_auto {{slide_direction == 0 ? 'text_auto_hover' : ''}}">
      <text>每一个入世的人，都该有一个出世的地方</text>
      <view class="special_character">
        <text>自打国人心中最柔软和诗意的地方，</text>
        <text>被陶渊明称作桃花源</text>
      </view>
      <view class="special_character">
        <text>一代一代的我们，</text>
        <text>便有了一份执着的向往和寻找...</text>
      </view>
      <view class="special_character">
        <text>云舍村是一个归居式的传统村落，</text>
        <text>一个东方村落的共享空间 </text>
      </view>
      <view class="special_character">
        <text>这里没有经理和客人，</text>
        <text>只有村长和村民 </text>
      </view>
      <view class="special_character">
        <text>这里追求的不是奢华，</text>
        <text>而是让奢华归真返朴。 </text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
  <bottom-tab></bottom-tab>
</view>